WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Exodia Necross

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.410
Strike back with Dragon Sword!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:48.310
That was a recreation of Battle City.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:53.190
I almost became lost in my memories.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.160
You tried to trick me, Noa!

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.540
Just wait, Gozaburo.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.570
I'll force you to reopen the exit.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:07.050
My road of battle cannot end here!

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.860
Damn!  Noa tricked us!

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.180
He got us!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:24.390
Jonouchi, don't be so certain.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.660
But Mokuba is missing too!

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.560
Noa must've kidnapped him again!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:35.750
He may have stolen Mokuba's body and gone to the real world alone.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.800
Yeah.  That's a possibility.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.740
I wonder if Mokuba is okay.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:43.910
What do you think, my other self?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.540
I...

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:51.680
Unfortunately, it's natural for everyone to accuse Noa.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:52.850
Yeah.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:57.660
Partner, I know that you want to trust Noa.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:02.660
But he's done so many bad things.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:07.400
Otogi!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.230
Shizuka!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.910
It's difficult to convince them to trust Noa.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.420
I know, but...

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.420
Kaiba is also missing.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.420
Mokuba may be with Kaiba.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.090
Maybe.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.500
Anyway, let's find Noa.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:40.530
Or we'll never escape this virtual world.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.530
That'll be bad!  Screech!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.460
Let's go find him!  Screech!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.220
This is bad.  Honda is behaving more like a monkey.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.970
We need to find Noa fast!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.020
Who are they?

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.040
Shizuka!

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.180
Curse of Dragon!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.720
Hell Flame!

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.520
I see!

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.130
Here I go!  Axe Raider!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.700
Changing Program File M2A5.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:19.620
Changing missile target to underwater moving fortress.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:25.340
Seto, I'll fire a missile to destroy this fortress and kill you.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.970
And Yugi.  And my father.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:38.950
Seto, I get the last laugh.  Not you.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.800
Welcome, Seto.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.740
I wanted to have a nice, long talk with you.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.940
Don't make me laugh.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.100
Don't be like that.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.110
We have plenty of time.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:27.800
Even if I had a million hours, there's only one thing I want to say to you.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.970
Send us back to the real world!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:40.140
Why don't we decide it in a game?

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:46.310
Just like when you asked me to adopt you.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.100
That's a waste of time.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:54.910
You couldn't beat me when I was a kid, so how can you beat me in chess now?

00:06:56.740 --> 00:07:01.030
You really think I tried my hardest against a kid?

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.880
You're making excuses?  Pathetic.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.450
Whatever.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.970
But we won't play chess this time.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.040
We'll duel.

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.980
What did you say?

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.570
What's wrong?

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:19.200
I'm willing to challenge you at your best game.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:23.820
So you want to do the opposite of last time.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:30.490
You had the blueprint ready to take over Kaiba Corporation since that day.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.140
Then let me ask you.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:36.430
What's the merit for challenging me?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:40.370
I absolutely despise you.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:45.370
You stole Kaiba Corporation from me and took my life!

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.310
You're blaming me for your death?

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:52.320
That's why I will end you now.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.370
And it must be in a duel, your specialty.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:04.800
When I completely crush you, you'll learn that you're no match for me!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.800
Fine.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:11.770
No matter who or when, I never turn down a duel!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.200
I accept this duel!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.040
Destroy everything!

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.780
System is down.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.780
Switching to emergency circuits.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.820
How dare he interfere!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.400
It unlocked!

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.500
Get ready to depart!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.680
Here I go, Seto.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.440
My turn.  I draw.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.780
The spell card, Painful Choice.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.360
Painful Choice?

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:15.240
An entrepreneur must always make choices.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:19.430
Even if the choice is painful.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:25.110
If you're making painful choices, you're making bad decisions.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:30.250
Due to Painful Choice, I choose five cards from my deck and show them to you-

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.740
You don't need to explain the card to me!

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.960
I choose one of them, and the rest go to the graveyard.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:41.340
The one I choose goes to your hand.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.960
Hurry up and show me your cards!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.840
Of course you knew.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:50.200
Then take a good look.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.400
Choose from these five cards.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:02.170
What?  Those cards are...

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.270
Exodia?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.420
You should see the look on your face.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:37.600
Do you think I'd challenge you to a duel without doing any research?

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.210
What?

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.750
I completely studied your deck.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.290
And your humiliating defeat.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.760
Impossible!  Exodia?

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:54.170
The fires of rage!  Exodo Flame!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.750
You...

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:08.180
You think I can't get over a defeat?

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.610
Now choose.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.050
What's he thinking?

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:22.300
When you have all five Exodia cards in your hand, you automatically win.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.990
Why would he send four of them to the graveyard?

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.360
Hurry up and choose, Seto.

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:31.930
Slow decisions lead to bad judgments.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.620
That one.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:44.310
The remaining cards go to the graveyard.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:48.960
I set a monster in defense position.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.620
I end my turn.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.620
What's he up to?

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:58.060
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.800
System restored.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.240
I'll succeed this time!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.180
Missile target locked on.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.770
Good.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.640
You'll die too.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.440
Everyone, it's game over.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:29.060
Missile launch in 30 minutes.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.820
This way!

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:37.620
Will they find us?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:40.550
I think we're safe now.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.260
Oh no!  They found us!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.710
Damn!  We have to fight!

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:54.820
Missile launch in 25 minutes.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.750
The control room.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.690
What's this?

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:07.920
I don't know what's going on, but it seems interesting.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.110
Missile launch in 23 minutes.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.440
I missed you, Father!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.800
I was alone all this time!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.010
I'm done with you.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:49.170
How about we give up and live together in this world, as Father says.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.620
Once you get used to it, this place is fun.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:55.710
Noa!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:58.970
How can you say that?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.550
Gozaburo abandoned you!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.880
You're hurting me, Mokuba.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:11.200
If you promise never to harm my brother again...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:16.970
...I'll ask him to give you a new body.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.960
We're brothers after all.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:28.180
What a fool.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:37.500
Brothers?  Friends?  Friendship?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:43.760
I'll blow them up with a missile.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.480
Missile launch in 21 minutes.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:53.970
I'll blow them up with a missile...

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:59.290
I summon Black Luster Soldier!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.770
Chaos Blade!

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.080
Go!  Axe Raider!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:11.420
Missile launch in 18 minutes.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:14.060
Damn!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:17.510
Who cares about brothers, friends or friendship!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.430
Damn!  He must've done this!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:31.010
I can't stop the missile anymore!

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:40.800
I set one card and summon Vorse Raider!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:49.440
I don't know what card you set, but cheap tricks won't work on me.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.360
I destroy anyone who stands in my way!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:56.340
Vorse Raider, attack the defending monster!

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:08.280
What?  He summoned an Exodia part?

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.500
What's he planning?

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.020
I end my turn.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.000
I was waiting for this moment.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.600
My turn.  I draw.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:26.300
From my hand, I activate the Ritual Spell, Contract with Exodia.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.060
Contract with Exodia?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:39.320
I can activate this Ritual Spell when all five Exodia parts are in the graveyard.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:44.740
By paying 2000 life points, I can summon Exodia Necross.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.180
Exodia Necross?

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.370
That's right.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.740
Seto, watch with your own eyes.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:57.110
The Exodia that defeated you resurrects to the field!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.720
Exodia!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.500
How's that!

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.650
Did you miss it?

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.000
Silence!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:34.090
I'm not afraid of a lame monster with only 1800 attack points!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:37.110
Lame monster?

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:43.100
You know nothing about Exodia.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.120
Here I go!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.480
Exodia Necross attacks!

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:47.440
What?

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:52.810
You're attacking my monster even though Exodia has fewer attack points?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:06.290
Why isn't it destroyed?

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:11.040
Exodia Necross is invincible.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:15.480
And it gains 1000 attack points every time it battles.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.600
What?

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:25.440
Exodia Necross will keep gaining attack points and destroy everything!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:26.910
I end my turn!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.850
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:32.790
I'll just have to destroy it using my combo attack!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.970
I summon Spirit Ryu!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:39.730
I flip over my set card!

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:42.960
I activate the trap card, Burst Breath!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:49.530
I tribute Spirit Ryu to destroy all monsters with 1000 or fewer defense points!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:51.470
Perish, Exodia!

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:55.600
What?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:59.580
Why isn't Exodia destroyed when it has 0 defense points?

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.580
I'll tell you why.

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:10.460
Exodia Necross gains an effect for every Exodia part in the graveyard.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:16.560
Due to Left Leg of the Forbidden One, spells can't destroy it.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:22.370
Due to Right Leg of the Forbidden One, traps can't destroy it.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:28.320
Due to Left Arm of the Forbidden One, monster effects can't destroy it.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:34.430
Due to Right Arm of the Forbidden One, it gains 1000 attack points after it attacks.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:44.370
And due to Exodia the Forbidden One, it can't be destroyed in battle against other monsters.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.050
What?

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:52.500
The five Exodia parts in the graveyard have those effects?

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:58.940
Traps, spells and attacks can't destroy it?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:03.880
Is there any way to defeat Exodia Necross?

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:08.930
Exodia Necross is invincible!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.320
You'll never defeat it!

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.490
I set a card.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.490
I switch Vorse Raider to defense position.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.200
I end my turn.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.730
Missile launch in 10 minutes.

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.640
I summon Dark Magician!

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.430
I summon Rocket Warrior!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.160
Black Magic!

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:37.700
Invincible Mode!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:46.080
Virtual Domino City, can you hear me?

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.020
That voice is...

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:48.840
Noa!

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.680
Where are you, punk?

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:51.460
Come out!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.390
Seto.  And Father.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.560
I'm in the real world by borrowing Mokuba's body.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.330
What?  Noa!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:05.500
Dammit!  He tricked us and went to the real world by himself!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.770
Noa, you're so dirty!

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:11.500
Give Mokuba's body back!

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.210
And mine too!

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:14.570
Noa...

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:17.150
Time's running out, so I'll keep this short.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:21.510
A missile will soon be launched at this moving fortress.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:27.490
If you don't escape before then, you'll be destroyed along with the virtual world.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.530
What?

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:48.750
Big trouble!  Why is a missile targeting this fortress?

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:52.480
If we don't escape soon, we'll be blown up in this virtual world!

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:58.310
It's not right that only Noa is in the real world by borrowing Mokuba's body.

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:02.260
But our priority is to escape from this fortress!

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:05.770
But Kaiba is currently dueling his father!

00:22:05.770 --> 00:22:09.280
Please, Yugi!  Bring Kaiba with you!

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:11.060
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Escape!!

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.970
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:22.890
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:31.840
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:36.810
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:40.780
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:48.750
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:52.320
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:57.090
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.090 --> 00:23:07.200
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:14.810
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:23.780
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.780 --> 00:23:31.760
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:41.600
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
